        "claim": "The weakly magnetic spare could hold position and support gloved swaps through a mechanically indexed pocket. Strips bolted through existing slots supply side capture and end stops behind the marked edge; a movable fourth-strip gate supplies edge-free handling. Optional wire retains gate hardware; plate pickup uses an accessible unmarked surface, without assuming gate lift.",
